  <figcaption><span class="figure-title">Popularity does not predict efficacy.</span> Usage counts come from the WildTeaming corpus of tactics mined from real user logs; effectiveness is measured here on Llama-3.1-8B with the request held character-identical. Both axes describe the same sixteen tactics, which is why this pairing is plotted and the other corpora discussed in the text are not. Points below the zero line are tactics that make refusal <em>more</em> likely.</figcaption>
</figure>
